{
  "id": "29507_kakikaeru",
  "headword": "{書|か}き{替|か}える",
  "reading": "かきかえる",
  "romaji": "kakikaeru",
  "part_of_speech": "verb (ichidan)",
  "gloss": "to rewrite; to transfer (a registration); to renew",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to rewrite; to transfer or renew (a title, registration, or document)",
      "explanation": "To write something over again, or to update an official record by replacing the old entry with a new one. The {替|か}え here stresses substituting new content for the old; the same verb is more commonly written {書|か}き{換|か}える."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "29507_kakikaeru_ex1",
      "japanese": "{原稿|げんこう}を{書|か}き{替|か}える。",
      "english": "To rewrite the manuscript.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "29507_kakikaeru_ex2",
      "japanese": "{名義|めいぎ}を{書|か}き{替|か}える{手続|てつづ}きをした。",
      "english": "I went through the procedure to transfer the name on the title.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "29507_kakikaeru_ex3",
      "japanese": "{土地|とち}の{登記|とうき}を{書|か}き{替|か}える{必要|ひつよう}がある。",
      "english": "We need to transfer the registration of the land.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "29507_kakikaeru_ex4",
      "japanese": "{株主|かぶぬし}が{変|か}わったので、{帳簿|ちょうぼ}の{名義|めいぎ}を{書|か}き{替|か}えた。",
      "english": "Since the shareholder changed, we transferred the name in the ledger.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY:\nTransitive ({他動詞|たどうし}), taking を for what is rewritten or transferred.\n\nUSAGE:\n- {名義|めいぎ}を{書|か}き{替|か}える: to transfer the name on a title or registration\n- {登記|とうき}を{書|か}き{替|か}える: to update a registration\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {書|か}き{換|か}える: the more common spelling of the same verb\n- {書|か}き{直|なお}す: to rewrite — implies correcting or improving the text",
